      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Packers And Movers Dewas To Gwalior different from generic moving services?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our service combines a dedicated fleet of GPS‑tracked container trucks, ISO‑certified 7‑layer packaging, and real‑time route optimization on the Dewas‑Gwalior highway. This ensures faster transit, zero‑damage handling, and transparent pricing that generic movers cannot match.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical Dewas to Gwalior relocation take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the 850 km journey is completed in 12‑14 hours of driving time. Including loading, documentation, and post‑delivery checks, most customers receive their belongings at the new address within 24‑30 hours.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for moving goods between Dewas and Gwalior?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We provide IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % declared value. It protects against loss, theft, or damage during the entire highway transit, and the policy details are included in the final quotation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it moves from Dewas to Gwalior?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every container truck is equipped with satellite GPS and a 24/7 CCTV system. Clients receive a secure link to monitor real‑time location, temperature, and handling alerts until the cargo is safely unloaded.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book a Packers And Movers Dewas To Gwalior service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government ID, GST registration (if applicable), a signed moving contract, and a detailed inventory list. For corporate or government transfers, additional e‑Way bills and approval letters may be required.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for a Dewas‑Gwalior move calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The price is derived from four main components: distance‑based mileage charge, vehicle type surcharge (based on load volume), premium packaging fees, and statutory charges such as tolls and insurance. A transparent cost sheet is provided before finalizing the booking.</p>
